    "固定识别色帮助辨认指标；等级状态色随着评级变化。图示色用于柱形图等较大面积图形，标签背景与标签文字用于状态标签。颜色须与名称和数值一起呈现。": "A fixed identity color identifies a metric; status colors change with its rating. Chart colors suit larger graphics, while label backgrounds and text colors form status labels. Always pair color with names and values.",
