    "“未知”统一说明为“当前暂无可信读数”，不使用好坏等级色。空气污染物的六档文案可替换为具体指标名称；CO₂ 使用独立的三档通风提示。照度是单点场景提示，不代表任务面达标。": "Use “No reliable reading is available” for Unknown, without a good or bad rating color. The six pollutant messages can name the specific metric; CO₂ uses its own three ventilation levels. Illuminance is a single point scene hint, not proof that a task surface meets a target.",
    "先了解指标，再读懂评级": "Understand the metric, then its rating",
